%% Overheard - system architecture
%% Corrections against the earlier draft of this diagram:
%%   - Reddit removed. It is not reachable: unauthenticated requests return
%%     403, and with residential proxies the response is HTTP 200 carrying a
%%     "Prove your humanity" CAPTCHA. Reddit opinion still arrives indirectly,
%%     via aggregator pages that quote those threads.
%%   - Hacker News, Steam and Lemmy added. They are live sources and were
%%     missing entirely.
%%   - OpenAI added. It was absent, yet it both plans collection and performs
%%     all classification - the two places judgement happens.
%%   - Sentiment moved out of the Python box. Python cleans, dedupes and
%%     aggregates; the model classifies.
%%   - ElevenLabs shown as live. The integration lives on a separate branch
%%     and is not in this one, so the Vox panel here is still a local mockup.
%%     Worth confirming the branches are merged before demoing the voice.
 subgraph Sources["DATA SOURCES"]
        YouTube["`**YOUTUBE DATA API**<br>Comments under product videos`"]
        HackerNews["`**HACKER NEWS**<br>Algolia search, ~1000 per query`"]
        Steam["`**STEAM REVIEWS**<br>Games only - carries ground truth`"]
        Browserbase["`**BROWSERBASE**<br>Web search and page fetch`"]
        Lemmy["`**LEMMY**<br>Federated community comments`"]
  end
 subgraph Intelligence["OPENAI - gpt-5.6-sol"]
        Planner["`**COLLECTION PLANNER**<br>Chooses sources, writes queries per source`"]
        Analyzer["`**FEEDBACK ANALYZER**<br>Relevance, sentiment, intent, issue category<br>Batched 10 per call`"]
  end
 subgraph Backend["API AND ORCHESTRATION"]
        FastAPI["`**FASTAPI**<br>Auth, tenancy, collection jobs`"]
  end
 subgraph Processing["DATA PROCESSING - Python"]
        Clean["`**CLEAN AND NORMALIZE**<br>Dedupe by id and by text hash<br>Junk filter with a rejects log<br>One schema for every source`"]
  end
 subgraph Databases["DATABASES"]
        Elasticsearch["`**ELASTICSEARCH**<br>One tenant-aware feedback index<br>Aggregations and evidence retrieval`"]
        Supabase["`**SUPABASE**<br>Users, orgs, products, job state`"]
  end
 subgraph Experience["FRONTEND - React"]
        React["`**DASHBOARD**<br>Ranked pain points<br>Source breakdown<br>Evidence with citations`"]
        Vox["`**VOX ASSISTANT**<br>Ask questions, challenge a claim`"]
        ElevenLabs["`**ELEVENLABS**<br>Conversational voice agent`"]
  end
    FastAPI -- 1 plan --> Planner
    Planner -- source and query list --> FastAPI
    FastAPI -- 2 collect --> YouTube & HackerNews & Steam & Browserbase & Lemmy
    YouTube & HackerNews & Steam & Browserbase & Lemmy -- raw documents --> Clean
    Clean -- 3 classify --> Analyzer
    Analyzer -- labelled records --> Clean
    Clean -- 4 index --> Elasticsearch
    Supabase <-- auth and ownership --> FastAPI
    Elasticsearch -- 5 analytics and evidence --> FastAPI
    FastAPI --> React
    React --> Vox
    Vox <--> ElevenLabs
    ElevenLabs -- grounded answers with citations --> FastAPI
